# Game Canvas (Gated · SPFx web parts)

## When to use
- Compliance Tower, Shield Up, Raise the Alarm, WTRM, Follow the Path, similar game controllers/renderers

## Architecture (match existing)
- **Controller + renderer** classes; canvas/DOM under web part root — not full React re-render per frame
- `requestAnimationFrame` for draw loop; avoid heavy sync work inside rAF
- Audio via existing `*AudioService` patterns; respect mute/user prefs
- SharePoint persistence via existing services (`*DataService`, `*ProgressService`) — route PnP details to `spfx-gated`

## Performance
- Pre-size canvas; handle resize with debounce where project already does
- Batch DOM reads/writes; no layout thrash in hot paths
- Lazy-load heavy assets; use project optimize scripts paths when adding media

## Safety
- Sanitize CMS-authored strings before DOM (`dompurify` / `textContent` patterns)
- No `eval` of scenario JSON; validate config shapes
- Leaderboard/user identity → `security-appsec` (PII)

## Visual polish
- Non-canvas UI chrome → SCSS `transition` / CSS `@keyframes`; Fluent toolbars/dialogs → `fluentui-gated`

## Reject
- Rewriting canvas game as React state + CSS animation "for simplicity"
- Unity/GameMaker upstream dumps from awesome-cursorrules
- New game framework deps (Phaser, Pixi) without explicit approval
